dsstack contains original skills and Python tooling by doublesharp.

Workflow ideas adapted from:
- t3dotgg/tstack, MIT. Bounded review, scoped re-review, and explicit PR ownership.
- obra/superpowers, MIT. Behavioral RED/GREEN, root-cause debugging, and resumable progress.

Retained upstream license notices are in licenses/. Exact source revisions and
file hashes are recorded in upstreams.lock.json. Adaptations change the behavior:
TDD is proportional to the affected behavior, whole-workspace checks occur at
required integration gates, and rare high-impact risks are not automatically nits.
No upstream installer, hook, runtime, or downloaded code is executed by dsstack.
Official tool documentation is linked in docs/provenance.md for domain guidance.
